=== P4 Shared surface 0135 ReleaseNotes (Apple) ===

SURFACE
  Native Apple-idiomatic parity of web/src/components/feedback/ReleaseNotes.tsx — the compact,
  collapsible release-notes accordion that consumes the auto-generated @/generated/changelog module.
  Shipped at apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/ReleaseNotes.* (10 files), bound through the P1/S8
  state-holder seam, the P1/S9 design tokens, the P1/S10 i18n facade, and the P1/S11 diagnostics
  contract. No networking lives in the view.

FILES (apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/)
  ReleaseNotes.swift            — container view (header + banner + content switch), accordion @State,
                                  default-open-newest, view.opened on appear.
  ReleaseNotes.Model.swift      — i18n facade (table "ReleaseNotes"), telemetry seam + OSLog default,
                                  connection axis, input snapshot, resolved state, @Observable model,
                                  InMemoryReleaseNotesSource.
  ReleaseNotes.Adapter.swift    — pure DTOs (ReleaseNotesEntry/Change/badge/type), tone mapping
                                  (web ICON_TINT/BADGE_VARIANT/DOT_TINT), ISO-date formatter, a11y join.
  ReleaseNotes.Projection.swift — pure resolve(input)->resolved (slice/limit, newest-first, item map).
  ReleaseNotes.Views.swift      — accordion list/row (glass panel + header button + badge + chevron),
                                  change row (tinted dot + text), empty state, tone->token palette.
  ReleaseNotes.Chrome.swift     — freshness chip, refresh button, connectivity banner, loading
                                  skeleton, retryable error (TSButton).
  ReleaseNotes.Previews.swift   — #Preview per state (data / single / empty / loading / error /
                                  stale / offline).
  ReleaseNotes.Tests.swift      — projection phases + content, model wiring, telemetry-once,
                                  stale auto-refresh, a11y (XCTest).
  ReleaseNotes.AdapterTests.swift — date formatting, badge/type tone maps, label key/fallback, a11y.
  ReleaseNotes.strings          — parity keys + change-type a11y keys + native chrome keys.

PARITY (reproduced from the web source — verified, not assumed)
  data           → CHANGELOG.slice(0, limit) newest-first; single-open accordion defaulting to
                   releases[0].version (web useState); tap-open-row collapses all (setExpanded(
                   isExpanded ? null : version)).
  per release    → gift glyph tinted by badge, v{version}, <Badge> variant, date, chevron up/down;
                   expanded body = "What's New" heading + change list (dot tinted by change type + text).
  BADGE_VARIANT/ICON_TINT : latest→success(emerald), stable→info(cyan), beta→warning(amber).
  DOT_TINT       : added→success, changed→info, fixed→warning, removed→danger, deprecated→purple,
                   security→danger (web rose==danger for removed AND security).
  i18n keys      : changelog.badges.{latest,stable,beta}, changelog.releaseNotes.heading — present
                   verbatim in the P1/S10 catalog (ReleaseNotes.strings) with the web English values.

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → skeleton release panels keeping the accordion shape (P4 leaf over the static web import).
  empty    → "No release notes yet" friendly glyph+message (web limit<=0 / empty CHANGELOG), never blank.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf; the static web import has no error path).
  data     → newest-first accordion of release panels (the parity body).
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over cached content; no auto-refresh.

